From 24d98c50f64e441bc65b38a79071d86b1fc868c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:30:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] tu/autotune: calibrate the bandwidth model and adapt it at
 runtime

Replace the fixed GMEM/sysmem byte weights with costs measured on the GPU
once per driver build and cached on disk. TU_AUTOTUNE_ADAPT optionally
corrects the model from measured render pass times.

Assisted by: Gemini
